      "traits": [
        "magical",
        "occult"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per minute</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature attempts to move within 30 feet of the nodocite surveiller</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The nodocite surveiller creates a bubble of disruptive magic, causing reality to ripple and warp around the triggering creature. The ground in a 10ft Type:burst around the triggering creature becomes difficult terrain.</p>",
